fund_digest_repair = "The restored-tree build refuses Fund at attempted CPU fuel 1000018 under the unchanged 1000000 cap; rewards.rs:apply_fund now writes the authenticated replay.digest into its event instead of hashing that identical unsigned request again; state and event equality remain asserted by the production allowance proof."
native_terminal_reader_repair = "The ordinary-call producer ffi_call.rs:PreparedAuthorizedActivityOutcome::Failure publishes terminal Failure(Program) with PROGRAM_REFUSED; host_boundary.rs, f03_evaluator_host.rs and rewards_native.rs decode that terminal with the exact program, Rejected class, result code and application-reason checks, retaining CandidateV4 decoding for successful and captured executions."

restored_second_build = "{\"revision\": \"daa2d1fc15ec9f79ccbdffa565f8b99dbaa0a3e8\", \"command\": \"make -s paxd-native-libs && CGO_ENABLED=1 go test -count=1 -run '^TestRepair478_' ./rpc/ && make -s paxai-host-boundary-build && cargo build --locked --manifest-path programs/Cargo.toml -p layerx-programs-ai-market --tests && python3 -m pytest -q tests/ci/test_ai_market_module_mirror.py\", \"exit\": 1, \"log\": \"/out/logs/build-2.log\"}"
fund_router_digest_repair = "The second build still refuses Fund at attempted CPU fuel 1000008; dispatch.rs passes the router's validated request digest directly to rewards.rs:apply_fund, which reuses it for replay and event production; direct rewards::apply computes that digest once, and all sequence, authority, epoch, config, roster and ledger checks remain unchanged."

