attempt_31_fund_checks = "FundingView::decode decodes the reward ledger head once; apply_fund moves its decoded state and preserves principal, domain, expiry, market, epoch, config, roster, funding authority, policy, consent, refund recipient, replay, phase, conservation, capacity, account binding, balance cover and transfer checks, and dispatch::transition exempts Fund from reputation carry-forward exactly as the direct Fund route does."
attempt_31_copy_repair = "Decision 2940 attributes the overrun to the checked copy helper introduced by 22.39.142; types.rs restores inlining and the standard slice-copy primitive while retaining the exact equal-length Wasm trap, with no public operation, application code, section layout, query result or existing production assertion change."
