attempt_31_refusal_findings = "The same verification reports workers_lifecycle.rs:607 expects BAD_VERSION for a v1-shaped body tagged v2 while the unchanged decoder returns NON_CANONICAL, f04_recovery.rs:1440 expects F03_REPORT_ALREADY_FINAL while commit_reveal.rs returns CONFLICT, reputation lifecycle and vectors retain their failure names above, and host_boundary.rs:1029 expects F07_UNKNOWN_WORKER while the producer returns UNAUTHORIZED; decision 2940 forbids changing these public refusal codes or test assertions, so those failures are retained and recorded rather than relaxed."

attempt_31_gate_budget = "The first build failed on the pinned Hunter download, and the second build passed; hf-gate.py counts each extra build and verification invocation separately against two total reruns, leaving only one rerun after the failed verification. No passing full-suite result is claimed for the reader repair without matching successful final build and verification evidence."


